<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see rain in west, sun in east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see rain in west, sun in east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Friday were forecast to see rain in the west, sun in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see thundershowers with highs of 17 to 23 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sun and highs of 18 to 26 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sun with highs of 23 to 14 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
